    "long_instructions": "### **Write It Yourself**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Build:** In `script.js`, write code to make the **Decrease Progress** button work with a named arrow function.\r\n\r\n2. **Test:** Click both buttons and check that they work as expected.\r\n\r\n3. **Check Code:** Look for where the code:\r\n\r\n   * defines a named function\r\n   * uses arrow function syntax\r\n   * uses the function name as the event handler in `addEventListener`\r\n\r\n",
